# Allowlist: ignore everything, then re-include only what the runtime image needs.
# Safer than a denylist: a new secret/dump file at the repo root can never leak into the build context.
*

!package.json
!package-lock.json
!src/
!public/

# Never ship tests, caches or local artifacts even if they live under an allowed dir.
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.js
**/.steam-cache.json
**/node_modules
**/.DS_Store

# Explicit (already covered by `*`), kept for readers grepping for them:
# .git  .github  .claude  test/  docs/  tools/  scripts/  .env  *.log  server.js (v1)
